      "search:sku": "006V-04183",
      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 strain Slovakia/SK-BMC-BA11/2021- B.1.351 variant (a.k.a. 20H/501Y.V2 or &quot;South African variant&quot;) ",
      "search:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in March 2021. Its complete sequence is deposited on GISAID.org under the accession ID EPI_ISL_ 1234458. The virus belongs to the B.1.351 lineage (20H/501Y.V2 or \"South African variant\")). The virus is  preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C. Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been fully sequenced.",
