      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 strain Slovakia/SK-BMC-P1A/2021- B.1.1.7 variant (VOC 202012/01)",
      "search:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in January 2021. Its complete sequence is deposited on GISAID.org under the accesion ID EPI_ISL_77965.1. The virus belongs to the B.1.1.7 lineage (VOC 202012/01). The virus is  preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C. Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been fully sequenced.",
