      "dcterms:title": "WNV-E13",
      "dcterms:description": "West Nile virus original isolate. This West Nile virus[Ntaya virus group.] is preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C.Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been partly sequenced.",
